# Review routing for devtools. GitHub applies the last matching
# rule, so the supply-chain rules below override the default for the
# paths they name.

# Default owner for everything.
*           @tbhb

# Supply-chain and CI surface. The /.github/ rule already covers
# renovate.json5 and every workflow, so neither needs its own line.
/.github/   @tbhb
/vendor/    @tbhb
/go.mod     @tbhb
/go.sum     @tbhb
